= Overview =

This document describes the procedure to enable SSL connection between PKI server and the internal database.

There are several scenarios:
* [[Enabling-SSL-Connection-with-Internal-Database-on-New-Instance|Enabling SSL Connection with Internal Database on New Instance]]
* [[Enabling-SSL-Connection-with-Internal-Database-on-Existing-Instance|Enabling SSL Connection with Internal Database on Existing Instance]]
* [[Enabling-Secure-Connection-to-Internal-Database|Enabling Secure Connection to Internal Database]]

Once the SSL is enabled, see the following page to enable client certificate authentication:
* [[Configuring-Client-Certificate-Authentication-to-Internal-Database|Configuring Client Certificate Authentication to Internal Database]]

